NAME
       reboot - reboot or power off the machine

SYNOPSIS
       reboot
       poweroff
       shutdown [-r|-h|-P] [now]
       halt

DESCRIPTION
       reboot restarts the computer. poweroff, shutdown and halt turn it off
       through ACPI. Only root may do this.

OPTIONS
       -r
           reboot instead of powering off

       -h, -P
           power off

       now, -f
           accepted for compatibility

EXAMPLES
       reboot
       shutdown -h now

SEE ALSO
       ps(1)
